      "content": "thanks for the warning but he's really adamant he's just thirsty and doesn't want to deal with an ER visit or a long wait. he's been fine otherwise and hasn't had any chest pain or anything. if I just give him some electrolytes and have him rest for a few hours, would that be a safe way to just see if he settles down before we worry about a doctor? i dont want to overreact if it's just the heat.",
